Delete a project

Usage:
  mdr project delete <id> [flags]
Requires scope: PROJECT_DELETE. Supports --dry-run.
Requires --yes when stdin is not a terminal.

Arguments:
  <id>   project id or slug

Flags:
  -r, --reason <value>   why

Global flags (-o, --fields, --full, --dry-run, ...): see mdr --help

Examples:
  mdr project delete my-mod --yes

API: DELETE /project/{id|slug}
